+# most 250 with at most 50 integer digits (below 10^301, far from 1.8e308). Its conversion is deferred to the
+# parallel pass; every other token is converted here, so every `number out of range` keeps its place.
+def num.safe(+eneg: Bool, +x: Nat, +ints: String) -> Bool:
+  Bool.or(eneg, Bool.and(Nat.is_le(x, 250n), Nat.is_le(T.str_len(ints, 0n), 50n)))
